             *
             * Emitted only when the brand has not switched the notice off, so
             * a suppressing brand yields no element at all rather than a
             * permanently hidden wrapper. Class name matches the Luma,
             * WooCommerce and PrestaShop surfaces so the four checkout
             * treatments stay greppable; the Tailwind utilities alongside it
             * follow the same idiom as the payment-terms box below.
             *
             * It sits inside the form's Alpine scope, not the outer tile's,
             * because the form is the instance that runs initialize() and so
             * the one holding the order-intent state.
             */
            ?>
